{"id":"a830918010f1575a","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-prime-filter.md","title":"Prime Filter","display":"df-prime-filter — Prime Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-prime-filter","aliases":["93-df-prime-filter"],"display":"df-prime-filter — Prime Filter","depends_on":["[[93-df-filter]]","[[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-prime-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-prime-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prime-filter — Prime Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9beeac4373d773f8\" href=\"?note=9beeac4373d773f8\" title=\"93-df-filter\">93-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0454a0272a142daa\" href=\"?note=0454a0272a142daa\" title=\"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice\">93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\">\\(\\mathbf L\\)</span> is a bounded-distributive-lattice candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L^-\">\\(\\mathbf L^-\\)</span> is the reduct of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0454a0272a142daa\" href=\"?note=0454a0272a142daa\" title=\"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice\">93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fil}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fil}\\)</span> have the signatures fixed in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0454a0272a142daa\" href=\"?note=0454a0272a142daa\" title=\"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice\">93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9beeac4373d773f8\" href=\"?note=9beeac4373d773f8\" title=\"93-df-filter\">93-df-filter</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperLatFil}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperLatFil}_{93}\\)</span> is the proper bounded-lattice-filter predicate defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}\\)</span> is the prime-filter predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperLatFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\land F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf L^-)\n\\land F\\subsetneq|\\mathbf L|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperLatFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\land F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf L^-)\n\\land F\\subsetneq|\\mathbf L|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProperLatFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf L)\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\bigl(a\\vee^{\\mathbf L}b\\in F\\to(a\\in F\\lor b\\in F)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProperLatFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf L)\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\bigl(a\\vee^{\\mathbf L}b\\in F\\to(a\\in F\\lor b\\in F)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Priestley duality needs prime filters of bounded distributive lattices, not merely Boolean ultrafilters. The definition now depends only on its two arguments; in the Boolean case it is applied to the sourced bounded reduct <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B^{01}\">\\(\\mathbf B^{01}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"0454a0272a142daa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"0454a0272a142daa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf L$ is a bounded-distributive-lattice candidate and $\\mathbf L^-$ is the reduct of [[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"0454a0272a142daa","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Fil}$ have the signatures fixed in [[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]] and [[93-df-filter]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Fil}$ have the signatures fixed in [[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]] and [[93-df-filter]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf L^-","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fil}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperLatFil}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperLatFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\land F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf L^-)\n\\land F\\subsetneq|\\mathbf L|","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProperLatFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf L)\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\bigl(a\\vee^{\\mathbf L}b\\in F\\to(a\\in F\\lor b\\in F)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf B^{01}","display":false}],"bytes":1458,"backlinks":[{"id":"18e84a8354274052","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d8ba1827c96f11ce","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-prime-filter]] and [[93-df-ultrafilter]]."},{"id":"451c6d43dd774abe","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-ultrafilter]] and [[93-df-prime-filter]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-prime-filter]]"}],"outgoing":["9beeac4373d773f8","0454a0272a142daa"]}